{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09895","headline":"赴嘉州过城固县寻永安超禅师房 · 岑参","name":"赴嘉州过城固县寻永安超禅师房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满寺枇杷冬着花，老僧相见具袈裟。\n汉王城北雪初霁，韩信台西日欲斜。\n门外不须催五马，林中且听演三车。\n岂料巴川多胜事，爲君书此报京华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}